\begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \hline
Gauge group & $q_{L}^i$ & $u_{R}^i$ & $d_{R}^i$ & $\ell_{L}^i$ & $e_{R}^i$ & $N_{R}^i$ & $H$ & $ \Phi $ \\ \hline
S$U(3)_{{C}}$ & ${\bf 3}$ & ${\bf 3}$ & ${\bf 3}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 1}$ \\ \hline 
S$U(2)_{{L}}$ & ${\bf 2}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 2}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 1}$ & ${\bf 2}$ & ${\bf 1}$ \\ \hline 
